<div class="lede">
<p><strong>The tool saves tokens only when the agent doesn&rsquo;t use it.</strong> Across four cells and
three models, graph calls, message count and token loss move together monotonically. The two cells
that &ldquo;won&rdquo; ran a prompt that announced a payload and shipped none &mdash; suppressing tool use in
