sent both cells negative.</p>
<p class="k">Mechanism: tokens <em>are</em> messages. log(tok)~log(msgs) elasticity <span class="mono">1.682</span>,
r=<span class="mono">0.957</span>; message-adjusted residual saving is <span class="mono">0.000</span> in every model.
An extra call is an extra message is ~+1.7% tokens. The calls displace no work &mdash; eg runs
<em>more</em> greps than the no-tool baseline.</p>
